sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant UI as Streamlit UI
    participant QS as Quiz Service
    participant RS as Repository Layer
    participant DB as SQLite
    participant PS as Progress Service

    U->>UI: Select level and quiz mode
    UI->>QS: request_question(level)
    QS->>RS: fetch_quiz_question(level)
    RS->>DB: SELECT question by level and type
    DB-->>RS: question row
    RS-->>QS: Question DTO
    QS-->>UI: Render prompt

    U->>UI: Submit answer
    UI->>QS: evaluate_answer(question_id, answer)
    QS->>RS: fetch_answer_key(question_id)
    RS->>DB: SELECT answer
    DB-->>RS: answer key
    RS-->>QS: Answer key
    QS-->>UI: Result (correct or incorrect + explanation)

    UI->>PS: record_attempt(user_id, question_id, is_correct)
    PS->>RS: persist_attempt(...)
    RS->>DB: INSERT attempt and update stats
    DB-->>RS: success
    RS-->>PS: success
    PS-->>UI: updated streak and mastery score
    UI-->>U: Feedback, score, next recommendation
